    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/422f9557f6a3f5deba9bfe93a07baeaa.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><br>Four or five o'clock in a bar.<br>A man puts his hand on my shoulder and digs into my pocket, while his other hand picks up the broken gold from the table and puts it in his own pocket.<br>&quot;Come with me, it's quite a lot of money after all ...... huh... I can get you something extra.&quot;<br>He opened the door in front of him, and at the door ...... was a cat demon girl.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/5f98b9921717d12e7ed4f890ed73b4dd.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><br><br>&quot;In this world, although the demon is rare, but the matter of buying and selling them is already strange, I'm not easy to get one, although the bloodline is not very pure ...... but this appearance as you can see, the top quality goods!&quot;<br>The man lowered his voice and leaned close to my ear...<br>&quot;I'm sure your dead friend would have accepted it...&quot;<br>I tugged at the man's collar and pushed him aside, wondering what he meant by that, while the cat-demon girl on the floor gave me a frightened look ......<br><br>&quot;She's been on a hunger strike since she came to me, and I'm afraid she won't live much longer if she continues like this, so ...... apart from trying to earn some more... by giving it to you, I'm also doing a good deed.<br>&quot;No matter what happens, I'm your saviour too, loosen your hand and take her back, you won't regret it and I believe in you as a person.<br>&quot;Hey, he's your master now, go back with him.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/ee80d974692ea216316c32cbe702d2e8.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><br><br>The young girl mumbled ...... the word master ......<br>In the end, I took the young girl back to the residence...<br>&quot;If you are willing to trust me, I will be your ...... master from now on, and you won't have to hurt yourself so much by going on hunger strike. &quot;<br>&quot;Master ...... man ......&quot;<br><br>In the days that followed, I continued to live my life as a postman ...... except that there was another cat demon girl with me.<br>And this cat demon girl, her name is Suzu, is a ...... girl I will never forget.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/ec79b4d3641681490c447b3b599195c3.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6How to play</h2><br>The game is mainly a simulation of the type of gameplay by selecting certain \u3010Interaction\u3011 to drive the time and certain values to trigger the event!<br>\u3010Interaction\u3011 can be performed several times a day.<br>\u3010Interaction\u3011 includes \u3010Talking\u3011 \u3010Working\u3011 \u3010Going out\u3011 \u3010H\u3011 \u3010Dressing up\u3011 and so on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/f52ccd75b09727a7bbe979d7fd39aae4.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><br><br>There are also many H and non-H events that can be unlocked with certain actions.<br>In addition, \u3010H\u3011 has many costume differences and poses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/38603cc7f7436bace454b0d53a83edff.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><br><br>\u3010Work\u3011 There is a special time mechanism.<br>\u3010Interaction\u3011 There is a function to give and use certain items.<br>\u3010Dress up\u3011 You can change your clothes and expression in some CG.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/5a47b11f98c88e843a9f6c68c7ba8b63.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game features</h2><br>\u25c723 basic CGs, CG difference 250+.<br>\u25c7The game text is 90,000+.<br>\u25c7Drama oriented game<br>\u25c7Game ending: 3 types<br>\u25c7Medieval timeline style gameplay<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651560/extras/3d277b27aaa4215e8fcc70b60d462655.avif?t=1740034431\" width=614 height=346 /></span>",
